        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor(agents): make API registry ownership lifecycle-local",
        "body": "Related: #90741\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nResolves an ownership problem where model/session runtimes shared a mutable process-global API-provider registry. Independent runtime lifecycles could reset or publish providers into the same registry, making stream routing depend on process history instead of the prepared model/session owner.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nEach `ModelRegistry` lifecycle now owns an isolated API registry and LLM runtime. Prepared models and stream entry points carry that runtime forward to agent sessions, compaction, worker inference, utility completions, and media paths; provider factories register against the supplied lifecycle registry. The shipped process-default Plugin SDK facade remains available for explicit compatibility publication, but runtime hot paths no longer use it as their owner.\n\nThe Amazon Bedrock provider now publishes its transport through the provider lifecycle instead of eagerly registering into the process default. No config, protocol, or user-visible behavior changes are introduced.\n\nAI-assisted: implementation and review were completed with Codex; the maintainer reviewed the full changed modules, callers, sibling paths, tests, and runtime ownership contracts.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended user-visible change. Model and provider routing is deterministic per runtime lifecycle, preventing one session or registry reload from mutating another runtime's API-provider table.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs packages/ai/src/internal/default-runtime.test.ts extensions/amazon-bedrock/index.test.ts src/agents/btw.test.ts src/agents/custom-api-registry.test.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/compact.hooks.test.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/stream-resolution.test.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/attempt.test.ts src/agents/google-simple-completion-stream.test.ts src/agents/provider-stream.lifecycle.test.ts src/agents/sessions/model-registry.test.ts src/agents/sessions/sdk.test.ts src/agents/simple-completion-runtime.test.ts src/agents/simple-completion-transport.test.ts src/gateway/worker-environments/inference-runtime.test.ts src/llm/stream.test.ts src/media-understanding/image.test.ts src/plugins/contracts/tts-contract-suites.ts` — 566 tests passed across 6 shards on the final rebased head.\n- `node scripts/check-changed.mjs -- <46 changed files>` — passed formatting, Plugin SDK baseline, plugin boundaries, core/core-test/extension/extension-test typechecks, core/extension lint, import-cycle, database-first, media, webhook, and pairing guards on Blacksmith Testbox.\n- Testbox: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29669788485\n- Fresh branch-wide autoreview and each repair delta reported no accepted/actionable findings.\n",
